  "data": {
    "body": "Consider the following differential equation: \\[\\frac{dx}{dt}=(x+1)(3-x)+h\\] where h is a parameter. Determine the number of critical points depending on the value of h.\n(You don't need to solve the differential equation.)",
    "solution": "\\[\n\\begin{cases} \nh = -4 & \\text{1 critical point} \\\\\nh < -4 & \\text{0 critical points} \\\\\nh > -4 & \\text{2 critical points} \n\\end{cases}\n\\]",
